    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759660/extras/05acc96fbe5a86c54ca40ac44f6722c4.avif?t=1722704675\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br>A unique and challenging Foddian-esque game where control is everything but easy. You play as a box equipped with a cannon, navigating through distinct biomes, each offering new obstacles and environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759660/extras/01ec4728f76ef4fd38c5cdbd7f482795.avif?t=1722704675\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Customization: </strong> Completely customize your cannon, box and trim! Over 410+ different combinations with customizable colors!<br><strong>Many Distinct Zones: </strong>Navigate through dark caves, the jungle, a techno factory, an electro-inverted cavern, and many, many more! Each offering unique challenges.<br><strong>Cannon Propulsion: </strong>Master the art of movement by utilizing your attached cannon - it\u2019s not as easy as it looks!<br><strong>Obstacles Galore: </strong>From slime in the Jungle to moving tiles in Techno Zone and magnets in Underside \u2013 every level brings new hurdles.<br><strong>Checkpoints &amp; Spikes: </strong>Save progress at checkpoints but beware of deadly spikes ready to halt your ascent.<br><strong>In Clumsy Cannon every jump counts; </strong>Every shot from your cannon could mean ascension or free fall. Are you ready for this exhilarating challenge?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=400 height=100 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759660/extras/05acc96fbe5a86c54ca40ac44f6722c4.avif?t=1722704675\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br>A unique and challenging Foddian-esque game where control is everything but easy. You play as a box equipped with a cannon, navigating through distinct biomes, each offering new obstacles and environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759660/extras/01ec4728f76ef4fd38c5cdbd7f482795.avif?t=1722704675\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Customization: </strong> Completely customize your cannon, box and trim! Over 410+ different combinations with customizable colors!<br><strong>Many Distinct Zones: </strong>Navigate through dark caves, the jungle, a techno factory, an electro-inverted cavern, and many, many more! Each offering unique challenges.<br><strong>Cannon Propulsion: </strong>Master the art of movement by utilizing your attached cannon - it\u2019s not as easy as it looks!<br><strong>Obstacles Galore: </strong>From slime in the Jungle to moving tiles in Techno Zone and magnets in Underside \u2013 every level brings new hurdles.<br><strong>Checkpoints &amp; Spikes: </strong>Save progress at checkpoints but beware of deadly spikes ready to halt your ascent.<br><strong>In Clumsy Cannon every jump counts; </strong>Every shot from your cannon could mean ascension or free fall. Are you ready for this exhilarating challenge?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" width=400 height=100 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Clumsy Cannon is a game where you play as a box with a cannon, trying to reach the top of different zones. Master the art of cannon propulsion and overcome various obstacles in this unique and challenging game.",
